      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Haledon%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The area that is now North Haledon began as 18th‑century farmland settled by Dutch and German families.",
