        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://hereforyoucentral.com/north-haledon-nj-hillside-pride-generational-roots-and-a-borough-ready-for-renewal/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The North Haledon Public Library serves as a cozy hub for reading, tutoring, and quiet study.",
