      ],
      "source": "https://hereforyoucentral.com/north-haledon-nj-hillside-pride-generational-roots-and-a-borough-ready-for-renewal/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Locals pronounce the borough’s name as “North HAIL‑don.”",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
