      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Haledon%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "North Haledon operates under New Jersey’s most common borough form of municipal government, used by 218 of the state’s 564 towns.",
